{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat collab/jolt/1795202000000-engineer-p1d-r3.prompt.md && git log -10 --oneline && rg -n 'gambit-runtime|defn- gambit-session' src/dev/yin_repl_launch.clj && ls -l build/tools/jolt-env.sh\"","aggregated_output":"Created-GMT: 2026-11-21 06:04:54 GMT\nSession-ID: 01a1f988-e9dc-75b3-adff-847824c691c5 (RESUME)\n# Task: P1d-r3 — cold-launch bridge compile: cache + progress + watchdog\n\nRole: VM Runtime Engineer (fix round; owner hit a \"freeze\" launching bb yin-repl --backend jolt-gambit)\n\n## Defect (owner report + orchestrator reproduction, live timings)\n\nFirst-ever `bb yin-repl --backend jolt-gambit` on a machine appears FROZEN at\n`gsc -dynamic -keep-temp joltffi-bridge.scm`: the cold bridge compile is a\nsilent multi-stage build (gsc scm->C, cc, link per module) taking 5-8 MINUTES\ntotal (measured live: cumulative gsc CPU 3:35+ across stages, all at ~95%\nCPU — working, not hung), with zero per-stage output, and each stage under a\n120s watchdog. A slow machine could exceed a stage budget and get SIGKILLed.\nWarm runs (cached boot + built bridge) are fast — the defect is the cold path.\n\n## Fix (three parts)\n\n1. **Cache the compiled bridge across boot builds.** The bridge artifacts do\n   not depend on the Yin boot (they depend on host/gambit/ffi inputs, already\n   digest-pinned). build-yin-boot.py creates a fresh runtime-* dir per build;\n   instead of recompiling the bridge inside each new dir, copy the\n   digest-verified compiled artifacts (bridge object + dylibs) from the\n   existing build/gambit-ffi/ cache into the new runtime dir (cmp/digest\n   verified before reuse, rebuilt only when the ffi input digests change).\n   Cold MACHINE = one compile ever; new boot build = copy.\n2. **Per-stage progress lines** on the cold path: echo each compile stage\n   before it runs (stage name + expected duration scale), so silence never\n   reads as a freeze. Progress goes to stderr or stdout consistently with the\n   launcher's other output.\n3. **Bridge-stage watchdog raised to 600s** (per stage) on the cold path.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Delete build/gambit-ffi + build/gambit-yin entirely (true cold machine) and\n  run bb yin-repl --backend jolt-gambit: measure total time (expect one\n  compile of ~5-8 min WITH per-stage progress lines, then a working yin>\n  session), session must complete the (+ 1 2) -> 3 smoke and exit cleanly.\n- Second run: must reuse BOTH caches (no gsc at all — verify by timestamp/\n  absence of compile lines) and reach yin> in seconds.\n- bb smoke:jolt-target both targets + bb bootstrap:jolt unchanged-green.\n- macOS regression only (Linux unchanged by this fix; note it).\n\nCommit on feat/p1d-uniform-launcher (worktree\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/p1d-uniform-launcher). Never\npush. Findings r3 section in your findings file. Return Completed-* header +\nthe measured cold/second-run times + per-fix status.\n41ab9b38 docs(yin.repl): document the uniform bb yin-repl launcher — five backends, per-backend capability notes, jolt-gambit degraded scope; P1d review artifacts\n48c3d5bd merge: feat/p1d-uniform-launcher (c46d90ba) — uniform yin.repl launcher: bb yin-repl --backend jvm|node|dart|jolt-chez|jolt-gambit; per-backend prereq builds artifact-gated (node 2.9s, dart 0.15s warm); gambit interactive PTY session with the compiled-boot cache; capability notes honest per C4. Plus standalone waitset bugfix (e9fe4f10): bind POSIX read citing upstream e20e2174. Review: agy flash ACCEPT-WITH-FIXES -> r2 -> CONFIRMED-CLOSED (cross-family). Tri-host gate: 20 JVM failures all pre-existing at master tip b22dff6f (verified per-namespace G0); Node/Dart legs completed\nb22dff6f docs(design): yang.preludes r8 — configurable composable preludes, three-tier hybrid architecture, signed off (astra architect + deepseek VM-engineer)\n1161ef1b docs(collab): archive yang.php orchestrator log and dart-leg records\ndbfef054 merge: archive aa174a11 master lint reds collaboration record\nb000b481 docs(collab): archive aa174a11 master lint reds fix, review, and architect sign-off\nfcb337ca merge: fix/aa174a11-master-lint-reds — use segment-matches? in code-entry-handler and allowlist eval_coordinator store context\n87a1cd6f fix(yin.vm): use segment-matches? in code-entry-handler and allowlist eval_coordinator store context\nc46d90ba feat(repl): add uniform bb launcher (P1d-r2)\n09a25523 fix(jolt): bind POSIX read in the Chez waitset\n94:(defn- gambit-runtime!\n136:(defn- gambit-session\n148:        runtime (gambit-runtime! cache-dir jolt-home prefix chez)\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 sto  staff  385 Nov 20 09:36 build/tools/jolt-env.sh\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
